This build statically links apple-codesign 0.29.0 (rcodesign), Copyright Gregory Szorc
and contributors, licensed under MPL-2.0. Its unmodified source is available at:
https://static.crates.io/crates/apple-codesign/apple-codesign-0.29.0.crate
https://github.com/indygreg/apple-platform-rs

The binding source and locked dependency versions are in:
https://github.com/ironpark/libcodesign

THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.html contains the Rust dependencies' license notices.
Cargo.lock records exact versions and checksums; cargo vendor --locked obtains
these dependency sources from their published crates.io source archives.
